        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 04387b7a-25fa-4dec-baa0-eeff1d36ab11).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47,\rThe constant has annoyed players for the final time, put an end to everyones misery and get rid of him for once. I know you&apos;ve always wanted to!\r\rYou also need to remove anyone celebrating the death of former target, Jaynus. Specially the burial planner, and the Master of Ceremonies. Have fun with this, we don&apos;t want any record of Jaynus left on the planet.\r\rGood luck 47,\rI shall leave you to prepare",
